<h1>About this archive</h1>
<p class="lede">This site preserves the Traveller_TNE Yahoo! Group — a mailing list for <em>Traveller: The New Era</em> fans, active May 2005 to January 2020 — as threaded, searchable posts, after Yahoo Groups shut down in 2020.</p>

<h2>Using the archive</h2>
<p>Browse by date or author, follow a thread from any post, or search across every post's subject and body — search understands word variants (searching "orbit" also finds "orbiting").</p>

<h2>Trademark &amp; copyright</h2>
