<h2 id="takedown">Notice &amp; takedown</h2>
<p>If you're the original author of a post archived here and would like it removed or anonymized, contact <a href="mailto:codemonki@outlook.com">codemonki@outlook.com</a>, or open an issue on <a href="https://github.com/code-monki/yahoo-groups-tne-archive/issues/new">the GitHub repository</a>.</p>
